    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14904" root="رجع" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْجَعُ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>More</i> [and <i>most</i>] <i>productive of return,</i>
or <i>profitable.</i> (TA.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هٰذَا أَرْجَعُ فِى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَدى مِنْ هٰذَا</span> (tropical:)  <i>This is more productive of return,</i>
or <i>profitable, in my hand than this.</i> (TA.)

